# Post-Commit Hook

After every commit:
1. Get commit SHA: `git rev-parse HEAD`
2. Push to origin: `git push origin main`
3. Sync worktrees:
   ```bash
   ssh hpc "cd ~/NeuralOps && git fetch origin && git reset --hard origin/main"
   ```
4. Verify all 3 worktrees have same SHA
